   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word;line-break:after-white-space\"><div>Has anyone run into the following error with oSCR.parfit(). It is thrown within a few minutes of the models starting up.</div><div><br></div>&quot;Error in { : task 1 failed - &quot;invalid iteration limit in nlm””<div><br></div><div>The call:</div><div><div>dens.mods &lt;- oSCR.parfit( mods=mods.d, </div><div>                          scrFrame=ms.sf,                      </div><div>                          ssDF=ms.ssDF,</div><div>                          trimS=35E3,</div><div>                          ncores=6)</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;word-wrap:break-word;line-break:after-white-space\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;word-wrap:break-word;line-break:after-white-space\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;word-wrap:break-word;line-break:after-white-space\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align:start;text-indent:0px;word-wrap:break-word;line-break:after-white-space\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align:start;text-indent:0px;word-wrap:break-word;line-break:after-white-space\"><div>Best,<br>Clayton<br><br>--<br>Clayton Lamb, PhD (he/him)</div><div>Postdoctoral Researcher | Liber Ero Fellow<br>Universities of British Columbia &amp; Montana<br>Residing in Fernie, BC | Ktunaxa Nation Territory<br>e: <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ctl...@ualberta.ca</a><br>p: <a href=\"tel:(778)%20215-0334\" value=\"+17782150334\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">778-215-0334</a><br>t: <a href=\"https://twitter.com/ClaytonTLamb\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://twitter.com/ClaytonTLamb&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792492054657000&amp;usg=AOvVaw13fBRMXrr6F-LB01GXCnoY\">@ClaytonTLamb</a><br>w: <a href=\"http://www.lamb-eco-research.ca\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.lamb-eco-research.ca&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792492054657000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0beheIi9FQRqCyByFC_HIv\">www.lamb-eco-research.ca</a></div><div><br></div></div></div></div></div><br></div><br><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<br></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
