     "<div lang=\"EN-GB\" link=\"blue\" vlink=\"purple\" style=\"word-wrap:break-word\"><div><div><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\">On Fri, 18 Dec 2020, 20:03 Clayton Lamb, &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ctl...@ualberta.ca</a>&gt; wrote:<u></u><u></u></p></div></div></div></div>"
