     3,
     "<div lang=\"EN-GB\" link=\"blue\" vlink=\"purple\" style=\"word-wrap:break-word\"><div><div><blockquote style=\"border:none;border-left:solid #cccccc 1.0pt;padding:0cm 0cm 0cm 6.0pt;margin-left:4.8pt;margin-right:0cm\"><div><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\">Has anyone run into the following error with oSCR.parfit(). It is thrown within a few minutes of the models starting up.<u></u><u></u></p></div><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\">&quot;Error in { : task 1 failed - &quot;invalid iteration limit in nlm””<u></u><u></u></p><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p></div><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\">The call:<u></u><u></u></p></div><div><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\">dens.mods &lt;- oSCR.parfit( mods=mods.d, <u></u><u></u></p></div><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\">                          scrFrame=ms.sf,                      <u></u><u></u></p></div><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\">                          ssDF=ms.ssDF,<u></u><u></u></p></div><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\">                          trimS=35E3,<u></u><u></u></p></div><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\">                          ncores=6)<u></u><u></u></p></div><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p></div><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p></div><div><div><div><div><div><div><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:black\">Best,<br>Clayton<br><br>--<br>Clayton Lamb, PhD (he/him)<u></u><u></u></span></p></div><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:black\">Postdoctoral Researcher | Liber Ero Fellow<br>Universities of British Columbia &amp; Montana<br>Residing in Fernie, BC | Ktunaxa Nation Territory<br>e: <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ctl...@ualberta.ca</a><br>p: <a href=\"tel:(778)%20215-0334\" value=\"+17782150334\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">778-215-0334</a><br>t: <a href=\"https://twitter.com/ClaytonTLamb\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://twitter.co